**W14-P1 (proposed, unassigned): Class-binding conformance suite for the four frozen cosmic-censorship classes.**
- Class IDs: AF-WCC-VAC-GEN (F1), AF-SCC-C2-VAC-GEN + AF-SCC-C0-VAC-GEN (F2).
